  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two metal blocks, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>, have the same mass. The specific heat capacity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is twice the specific heat capacity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>. Both blocks are heated from the same initial temperature by identical heaters for the same period of time.</p>\n<p>Which row compares the temperature change and the thermal energy absorbed by block <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> with those of block <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>?</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Temperature change of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span></th><th>Thermal energy absorbed by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-label=\"A\"><td>A.</td><td>twice the change of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td><td>same as that of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td>B.</td><td>half the change of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td><td>half that of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td>C.</td><td>half the change of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td><td>same as that of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td>D.</td><td>twice the change of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td><td>twice that of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>"
  },
